  "release_notes": "\u2022 Weather details now appear in a nonmodal in-game overlay; taps still reach the game and sidebar, and switching tabs closes the card.\n\u2022 Farm categories retain their selected seed, and unchanged selector labels, icons, and tabs no longer redraw every second.\n\u2022 Every unlocked farm plot stays visible across Crop, Herb, and Tree fields, including occupied plots from other field types.\n\u2022 Farm worker assignments continue to share the unlocked plot capacity.",
